 true Home Run King!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Live Match: Face off against rivals from around the world in real time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Club Battle: Join forces with your Club members to challenge the top clubs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[EASY]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># No more complicated controls! Enjoy simple one-touch play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Speed through games with Quick Play and play speed settings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Improved tutorials to make the game easier to understand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ># Upgrade system revamp. Check success rates at a glance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the thrill of baseball action with MLB 9 Innings Rivals 26!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/a65fd692500c2774c024f4606089564a.avif?t=1787709557\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras_big/a65fd692500c2774c024f4606089564a.avif?t=1787709557 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/91e5f9f94fd29a6c70c4e38e0c864cf2.avif?t=1787709557\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/f25b1e7fc7e9679a5de7f56548206d3f.avif?t=1787709557\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2569510/extras/cf667115ca141e8be8ee42d36dcc73ef.avif?t=1787709557\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256